 "notes": [
  "Requested piel sense \"crown\" is not attested for piel at all -- both piel forms mean \"besiege/surround\" (Judg.20.43, Ps.22.13) or \"wait\" (Job.36.2, Elihu asking Job's patience). \"crown\" is instead attested in an UNREQUESTED stem, hiphil (Prov.14.18, יַכְתִּירוּ דָעַת, \"the prudent are crowned with knowledge\"); hiphil also independently attests the \"surround\" sense (Hab.1.4, Ps.142.8). Moved \"crown\" from piel to hiphil accordingly, and added hiphil as a full paradigm entry since it's attested beyond the original request."
 ],
